      "title": "🔍 Guide: 4K 360° Panorama Bicubic Upscaler (Baseline)",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# 📐 4K 360° Panorama Bicubic Upscaler (Baseline)\n\nPure mathematical, zero-model, instantaneous upscaling benchmark for 360° equirectangular panoramas!\n\n### ⚙️ Pipeline Specifications\n• **Algorithm**: Antialiased Toroidal Bicubic Interpolation (`QwenPanoramaUpscale`).\n• **Instant Execution**: Takes < 0.05 seconds with virtually **0 GB VRAM** overhead.\n• **5% Toroidal Boundary Seam Wrap (`seamless_boundary: true`)**: Clones 5% opposite margins across edges before interpolating, ensuring the $0^\\circ / 360^\\circ$ wrap line is 100% seamless without vertical stitch lines.\n• **Resolution Target**: Native $2048 \\times 1024$ (2K) $\\to$ **$4096 \\times 2048$ (4K Ultra VR 2:1)**.\n• **Interactive 360° VR Viewer**: Drag with the mouse to inspect any angle of the upscaled 4K world directly in ComfyUI.\n• **Metadata Export**: Injects standard Google Photo Sphere XMP metadata so output PNG/JPG automatically triggers 360° VR playback on VR headsets, Google, and Facebook.\n\n---\n\n### 🚀 Quick Start Instructions\n1. Drop any generated 2K panorama (from our generation workflow) into **[Input 2K Panorama Image]**.\n2. Click **Queue Prompt**: your 4K equirectangular panorama will be ready instantaneously!\n3. Compare this baseline directly with **`Qwen_Image_2.1_4K_Panorama_Upscaler`** (RealESRGAN 2×) to see the neural detail difference."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# 📐 4K 360° Panorama Bicubic Upscaler (Baseline)\n\nPure mathematical, zero-model upscaling benchmark for 360° equirectangular panoramas!\n\n• **Algorithm**: Antialiased Bicubic Interpolation\n• **Resolution**: 2048x1024 (2K) -> 4096x2048 (4K)\n• **Seamless Seam Fix**: 5% toroidal boundary wrapping eliminates stitch lines."
      },
      "color": "#2a3a4a",
      "bgcolor": "#1d2833"
    },
